* CICS resource definitions for online pay enquiries
DEFINE TRANSACTION(PAYQ) GROUP(PAYGRP) PROGRAM(PAYINQ)
       DESCRIPTION(Pay enquiry)
DEFINE PROGRAM(PAYINQ) GROUP(PAYGRP) LANGUAGE(COBOL)
DEFINE URIMAP(PAYURI) GROUP(PAYGRP) USAGE(SERVER) SCHEME(HTTPS)
       PATH(/pay/v1/enquiries/*) PROGRAM(PAYWEB)
DEFINE URIMAP(PAYOUT) GROUP(PAYGRP) USAGE(CLIENT) HOST(rates.forge.example)
       PATH(/rates)
